    "description": {
      "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--2\"><p><em>武器（长弓），珍稀（需同调）</em><br />从这把弓射出的弹药，如同烧红般熠熠生辉着。当你用这把弓发动的攻击检定命中时，目标还会受到额外的[[/damage 1d6 type=fire]]伤害。若目标是一个可燃的、非魔法物件，它还会被点燃，并在每个你的回合开始时受到[[/damage 1d6 type=fire]]伤害直至一个生物用其动作熄灭火焰为止。</p><p>Ammunition fired from this bow blazes brightly. When you hit with an attack roll using this bow, the target takes an extra [[/damage 1d6 type=fire]] damage. If the target is a flammable, nonmagical object, it catches fire, taking [[/damage 1d6 type=fire]] damage at the start of each of your turns until a creature uses an action to extinguish the flames.</p></div>",
      "chat": ""
    },
